---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="ZenRows 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/zenrows.png`} alt="ZenRows" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">ZenRows 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">全合一 Scraper API，反封锁自动绕过</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">反封锁能力</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">IP 池规模</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">易用性</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">6.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          ZenRows 是一款全合一 Web Scraper API 服务，提供 Scraper API、Scraping Browser 和 Residential Proxies 三种产品。以自动反封锁绕过技术闻名，可轻松应对 Cloudflare、DataDome 等防护。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          拥有 5500 万+ 住宅 IP 资源，覆盖 190+ 国家，99.9% 正常运行时间。自适应隐身模式可自动选择最优配置，只支付成功的请求。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          支持 JS 渲染和智能代理轮换，从 $69/月起。适用于电商监控、新闻聚合、SEO 监测等场景。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">自适应隐身模式</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">自动从最简单便宜的配置开始，在需要时升级到 JS 渲染和 Premium 代理。只收取成功请求的费用，无需手动配置。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">反封锁自动绕过</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">内置反检测技术可自动处理 Cloudflare、DataDome、Akamai 等反爬虫系统。智能指纹识别和请求头轮换确保高成功率。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Scraper API + Browser</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Universal Scraper API 处理简单请求，Scraping Browser 处理需要 JS 渲染的复杂页面。两种工具覆盖从简单到复杂的爬取需求。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Premium 住宅代理</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">5500 万+ 住宅 IP 池，190+ 国家覆盖。支持按国家和城市级定位，99.9% 正常运行时间。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">灵活定价模型</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">按请求计费，基本请求 $0.10/千次起。请求复杂度越高花费越多，但只收取成功请求费用。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 电商数据采集</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">监控亚马逊、eBay 等平台的价格、库存和评论。自适应模式自动处理反爬虫系统。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 新闻聚合</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">批量抓取新闻网站内容，JS 渲染处理 SPA 应用。智能轮换避免被封。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. SEO 监测</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">通过全球住宅 IP 查看不同地区的搜索排名，进行 SEO 关键词研究和竞争分析。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. AI 训练数据</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">为 AI 模型采集大规模训练数据，包含 JS 渲染确保数据完整性。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>自动反封锁绕过</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>自适应隐身模式</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Scraper API + Browser 双模式</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>5500 万+ 住宅 IP</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L3.34 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>价格起点 $69/月较高</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>需 API 集成不适合小白</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>复杂请求成本倍增</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          ZenRows 以自动反封锁绕过和自适应隐身模式为核心竞争力，为数据采集提供了一站式解决方案。5500 万+ 住宅 IP 和 Scraper API + Browser 双模式覆盖了从简单到复杂的爬取需求。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，ZenRows 获得 7.0 分，适合有爬虫需求的开发者和企业用户。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://www.zenrows.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 ZenRows 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
